        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DASHS7, 7\" Double Acting Spring Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n7\" Double Acting Spring Hinge. Surface Type - Door flange is surface mounted into edge of door. Jamb flange is surface applied to door jamb. For doors 1-1/2\" to 2\" thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDeltana 7\" Double Acting Spring Hinges permit doors to open in either direction and automatically return to the closed position. \r\nPackaged complete with a Pair (2) Double Action Spring Door Hinges, Tension Adjusting Tool, Locking Pins plus wood mounting screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe included Tension Tool is use to adjust spring tension. The Locking Pins hold the Spring in tension after it is set. These adjustable tension spring hinges allow you to determine how much closing force you apply  to the door (how hard/fast the door self closes). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of Deltana DASHS7 Double Acting Spring Hinge\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Size: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Type: Surface Mount</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/2\" - 2\"  Thick Doors</b></li>\r\n<li>Maximum Swing:  90º each direction</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DASHS7-specifications.pdf?v=1774586590\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DASHS7 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DASHS-installation.pdf?v=1774586581\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DASHS Series Installation (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<!-- START Bommer 3029 -->\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#990000\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"special-items-table\">\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"7\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n    <span class=\"h-green\">Deltana DASHS-7 Hinge Selection for Maximum Door Size</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"24\"> \r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"70\">Deltana Hinge Number</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">2 Hinges</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">3 Hinges</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"130\">Door Thickness</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"50\">Min. Door Height</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"40\" bgcolor=\"#eeeeee\">\r\n<td>3029-7</td>\r\n<td>80 lbs</td>\r\n<td>32\"</td>\r\n<td>100 lbs</td>\r\n<td>34\"</td>\r\n<td>1-1/2\" - 2\"</td>\r\n<td>7'-0\"</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"7\"><span class=\"text\"><b>Note:</b> Do Not use on Doors with Hinge Edge Beveled.</span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</p><!-- END Bommer 3029 -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Pair (2 Hinges).</b>\r\n</p>",
